(window.AFYA_TX=window.AFYA_TX||{})["sn"]={"sn_cont_brief":[["Tape briefs are fully absorbent adult nappies that open flat and fasten with refastenable side tabs, so a carer can change them while the person lies down. Size by hip or waist measurement, not by clothing size: a brief that is too large leaks at the legs and one that is too small digs in and damages skin. A person with full incontinence typically uses 3–5 briefs a day, roughly 100–150 a month, so price per piece matters more than pack price. Change promptly when wet, clean with a gentle wipe and apply a thin barrier cream, because urine and faeces left on skin cause incontinence-associated dermatitis and pressure sores. Afya stocks a value, mid and premium tier in medium, large and extra-large so families can match budget to need without compromising skin.","Nepi za kubandika ni nepi kamili za watu wazima zinazofunguka zikawa bapa na kufungwa kwa vibandiko vya pembeni vinavyoweza kufunguliwa tena, hivyo mlezi anaweza kumbadilisha mtu akiwa amelala. Chagua saizi kwa kipimo cha nyonga au kiuno, si kwa saizi ya nguo: nepi kubwa kupita kiasi huvuja pembeni mwa mapaja na ndogo kupita kiasi hubana na kuharibu ngozi. Mtu asiyeweza kujizuia kabisa hutumia nepi 3–5 kwa siku, takriban 100–150 kwa mwezi, kwa hiyo bei ya kila kipande ni muhimu kuliko bei ya pakiti. Badilisha mara moja inapolowa, safisha kwa kitambaa laini chenye unyevu na paka krimu ya kinga kwa safu nyembamba, kwa sababu mkojo na choo vikibaki kwenye ngozi husababisha muwasho na vidonda vya kulala. Afya ina daraja la bei nafuu, la kati na la hali ya juu katika saizi za kati, kubwa na kubwa zaidi ili familia zilinganishe bajeti na mahitaji bila kuhatarisha ngozi."],["A daily, repeat-purchase need in every home caring for a bed-bound elder; high volume drives subscriptions and basket size","Hitaji la kila siku kwa kila nyumba inayomhudumia mzee aliye kitandani; mauzo ya mara kwa mara huongeza usajili na ukubwa wa kikapu"]],"sn_cont_pants":[["Pull-up pants are worn exactly like underwear and tear open at the sides for removal, which preserves independence for people who can still toilet themselves. They suit mild to moderate leakage and people with dementia who may pull at tape briefs. Choose by waist size and absorbency level, and check that the elastic is soft and the leg cuffs stand up to stop side leaks. Active users generally need 2–4 pants a day, about 60–120 a month. Afya offers a value local brand and a premium skin-friendly option so a family can trial the right fit before committing to a monthly box.","Nepi za kuvaa huvaliwa kama chupi ya kawaida na huchanwa pembeni wakati wa kuzivua, jambo linalolinda uhuru wa mtu ambaye bado anaweza kwenda chooni mwenyewe. Zinafaa kwa uvujaji mdogo hadi wa wastani na kwa watu wenye shida ya kusahau ambao huweza kuvuta nepi za kubandika. Chagua kwa saizi ya kiuno na kiwango cha unyonyaji, na hakikisha mpira wa kiuno ni laini na kingo za mapaja zimesimama ili kuzuia uvujaji wa pembeni. Mtumiaji anayetembea kwa kawaida huhitaji nepi 2–4 kwa siku, takriban 60–120 kwa mwezi. Afya inatoa chapa ya bei nafuu na chaguo la hali ya juu linalolinda ngozi ili familia ijaribu saizi sahihi kabla ya kujiunga na boksi la kila mwezi."],["Protects dignity and independence; a higher-margin step up from tape briefs with loyal repeat buyers","Hulinda heshima na uhuru; ni hatua ya juu yenye faida zaidi kuliko nepi za kubandika na wanunuzi waaminifu wa mara kwa mara"]],"sn_cont_lady":[["Bladder pads look like sanitary pads but use a super-absorbent core designed for urine, which flows faster and smells stronger than menstrual blood. Many older women use sanitary pads for leaks and still get wet and sore; a true continence pad locks urine away and neutralises odour. Choose the drop or level rating that matches the amount lost, and wear in close-fitting underwear. One to four pads a day is typical. Leaks are common but not a normal part of ageing that must be accepted: pelvic-floor exercises help most women, and anyone with burning, blood or sudden worsening should see a health worker.","Pedi za kuvuja mkojo zinafanana na pedi za hedhi lakini zina kiini chenye unyonyaji mkubwa kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya mkojo, ambao hutiririka kwa kasi na kunuka zaidi kuliko damu ya hedhi. Wanawake wengi wazee hutumia pedi za hedhi kwa uvujaji na bado hulowa na kupata michubuko; pedi halisi ya mkojo hufunga mkojo ndani na kuondoa harufu. Chagua kiwango cha matone kinacholingana na kiasi kinachovuja, na vaa ndani ya chupi inayobana vizuri. Pedi moja hadi nne kwa siku ni kawaida. Uvujaji ni jambo la kawaida lakini si sehemu ya uzee inayopaswa kukubaliwa tu: mazoezi ya misuli ya nyonga huwasaidia wanawake wengi, na yeyote mwenye kuungua, damu au hali inayozidi ghafla anapaswa kumwona mhudumu wa afya."],["Answers a hidden, embarrassing need discreetly; small packs sell often and open the door to the wider continence range","Hujibu hitaji lililofichwa na la aibu kwa usiri; pakiti ndogo huuzwa mara kwa mara na kufungua njia kwa bidhaa nyingine za mkojo"]],"sn_cont_men":[["Male guards are cup-shaped pads that sit inside close-fitting briefs and catch after-dribble or light leaks at the front, where men need absorbency most. Protective men's pants suit heavier leakage. Prostate enlargement is very common after 60 and causes weak flow, urgency and dribbling; a guard keeps clothes dry while the cause is checked. Most men use 1–3 guards a day. Any man with new urinary symptoms, blood in urine or pain should be assessed at a clinic, because prostate and bladder problems are treatable.","Kinga za wanaume ni pedi zenye umbo la kikombe zinazokaa ndani ya chupi inayobana na kudaka matone ya baada ya kukojoa au uvujaji mdogo upande wa mbele, mahali ambapo wanaume wanahitaji unyonyaji zaidi. Chupi za kinga za wanaume zinafaa kwa uvujaji mkubwa zaidi. Kuvimba kwa tezi dume ni kawaida sana baada ya miaka 60 na husababisha mkojo dhaifu, haraka ya kukojoa na matone; kinga huweka nguo kavu wakati chanzo kinachunguzwa. Wanaume wengi hutumia kinga 1–3 kwa siku. Mwanaume yeyote mwenye dalili mpya za mkojo, damu kwenye mkojo au maumivu anapaswa kuchunguzwa kliniki, kwa sababu matatizo ya tezi dume na kibofu yanatibika."],["Men rarely ask for help; a discreet, named male shelf converts silent need into loyal monthly sales","Wanaume mara chache huomba msaada; rafu maalum ya wanaume yenye usiri hubadilisha hitaji la kimya kuwa mauzo ya kila mwezi"]],"sn_cont_underpad":[["Underpads are flat absorbent sheets with a waterproof backing that lie under the hips to catch leaks the brief misses. A 60 × 90 cm pad covers a single bed seat area; larger sizes suit restless sleepers. Place the absorbent side up and never fold the plastic towards the skin, which traps heat and moisture. Households caring for a bed-bound person use one or two a day, about 30–60 a month. They also protect beds during nappy changes, bed baths and dressing changes, saving hours of laundry and protecting foam mattresses that are expensive to replace.","Pedi za kutandika ni karatasi bapa zinazonyonya zenye upande wa nyuma usiopitisha maji, zinazowekwa chini ya nyonga kudaka uvujaji ambao nepi haikuuzuia. Pedi ya sentimita 60 × 90 hufunika eneo la kukalia la kitanda cha mtu mmoja; saizi kubwa zinafaa kwa wanaojigeuza sana usingizini. Weka upande unaonyonya juu na usikunje plastiki kuelekea ngozi, kwa sababu huzuia joto na unyevu. Kaya inayomhudumia mtu aliye kitandani hutumia moja au mbili kwa siku, takriban 30–60 kwa mwezi. Pia hulinda kitanda wakati wa kubadilisha nepi, kuoshwa kitandani na kubadilisha bendeji, hivyo kuokoa saa nyingi za kufua na kulinda magodoro ya sponji ambayo ni ghali kununua upya."],["Bought alongside every brief; protects the family's mattress, a costly asset, and lifts basket value","Hununuliwa pamoja na kila nepi; hulinda godoro la familia lililo ghali na huongeza thamani ya kikapu"]],"sn_cont_washpad":[["Washable bed pads are quilted cotton-topped sheets with a waterproof, often non-slip, backing that can be laundered hundreds of times. They suit long-term care where disposable underpads become expensive and add to waste. Buy at least three so one is on the bed, one in the wash and one drying; wash at 60 °C with mild detergent and avoid fabric softener, which reduces absorbency. Dry in shade, as strong sun hardens the waterproof layer. They pay for themselves within one to two months compared with disposables, though disposables remain better for heavy soiling and infection control.","Pedi za kitanda zinazofuliwa ni shuka zilizoshonwa kwa tabaka, zenye uso wa pamba na upande wa nyuma usiopitisha maji, mara nyingi usioteleza, zinazoweza kufuliwa mamia ya mara. Zinafaa kwa huduma ya muda mrefu ambapo pedi za kutupa huwa ghali na huongeza taka. Nunua angalau tatu ili moja iwe kitandani, moja ikifuliwa na moja ikikauka; fua kwa maji ya nyuzi 60 kwa sabuni laini na epuka kilainisha nguo, kwa sababu hupunguza unyonyaji. Anika kivulini, kwani jua kali hukausha na kuharibu tabaka lisilopitisha maji. Hurejesha gharama yake ndani ya mwezi mmoja hadi miwili ukilinganisha na za kutupa, ingawa za kutupa bado ni bora kwa uchafu mwingi na kuzuia maambukizi."],["A one-off, higher-ticket purchase that wins budget-conscious families and supports sustainability","Ununuzi wa mara moja wenye bei ya juu unaovutia familia zinazojali bajeti na kuunga mkono utunzaji wa mazingira"]],"sn_cont_wipes":[["Adult wipes are larger and thicker than baby wipes, so one or two clean a whole area instead of a handful. Choose alcohol-free, fragrance-light wipes because older skin is thin and stings easily. Wipe front to back, use a fresh wipe for each pass and pat the skin dry before applying barrier cream. Never flush wipes, even if labelled flushable, as they block septic tanks and drains. A family doing four changes a day uses roughly two 72-wipe packs a month.","Wipes za watu wazima ni kubwa na nene kuliko za watoto, kwa hiyo moja au mbili husafisha eneo zima badala ya kiganja kizima. Chagua zisizo na pombe na zenye harufu hafifu kwa sababu ngozi ya wazee ni nyembamba na huwaka kwa urahisi. Futa kutoka mbele kwenda nyuma, tumia wipe mpya kwa kila mpito na kausha ngozi kwa kugusagusa kabla ya kupaka krimu ya kinga. Usitupe wipes chooni, hata zikiandikwa zinaweza kutupwa chooni, kwani huziba mashimo ya maji taka na mabomba. Familia inayobadilisha mara nne kwa siku hutumia takriban pakiti mbili za wipes 72 kwa mwezi."],["Low-cost add-on to every continence basket with fast monthly repeat","Nyongeza ya bei nafuu kwa kila kikapu cha bidhaa za mkojo yenye kurudiwa kila mwezi"]],"sn_cont_barrier":[["Barrier creams form a thin water-repellent film that keeps urine and faeces off the skin; zinc oxide, petrolatum and dexpanthenol are the proven ingredients. Apply a thin, almost invisible layer to clean, dry skin at each change: a thick layer blocks the brief from absorbing and makes cleaning harder. Redness that does not fade within a day, broken skin or a bright red rash with spots (often thrush) needs a health worker. A 100–250 g tube lasts two to four weeks with daily use. Good barrier care is the cheapest way to prevent incontinence dermatitis and pressure ulcers, which are painful, slow to heal and costly.","Krimu za kinga huunda tabaka jembamba linalozuia maji ambalo huzuia mkojo na choo kugusa ngozi; zinki oksaidi, mafuta ya petroli na dexpanthenol ndizo viambato vilivyothibitishwa. Paka safu nyembamba, isiyoonekana sana, kwenye ngozi safi na kavu kila unapobadilisha: safu nene huzuia nepi kunyonya na hufanya usafishaji kuwa mgumu. Wekundu usiopungua ndani ya siku moja, ngozi iliyochubuka au upele mwekundu wenye vipele vidogo (mara nyingi fangasi) unahitaji mhudumu wa afya. Tyubu ya gramu 100–250 hudumu wiki mbili hadi nne kwa matumizi ya kila siku. Utunzaji mzuri wa kinga ya ngozi ndiyo njia nafuu zaidi ya kuzuia muwasho wa mkojo na vidonda vya kulala, ambavyo vina maumivu, hupona polepole na ni ghali."],["Clinically essential companion to every brief; trusted brands with steady margin","Mwenzi muhimu kitaalamu wa kila nepi; chapa zinazoaminika zenye faida thabiti"]],"sn_cont_urinal":[["A urinal is a lidded plastic bottle with a shaped opening that lets a person pass urine in bed, in a chair or at the bedside. It removes the risky night walk to the toilet, which is when many older people fall. Male urinals have a narrow neck; unisex or female versions have a wider, angled opening. Choose one with a tight lid, measuring marks to track output and a handle that a weak hand can grip. Empty and rinse after each use and clean daily with hot soapy water and a dilute disinfectant.","Chupa ya kukojolea ni chupa ya plastiki yenye mfuniko na mdomo wenye umbo maalum unaomwezesha mtu kukojoa akiwa kitandani, kitini au kando ya kitanda. Huondoa safari hatari ya usiku kwenda chooni, wakati ambapo wazee wengi huanguka. Chupa za wanaume zina shingo nyembamba; za jinsia zote au za wanawake zina mdomo mpana ulioinama. Chagua yenye mfuniko unaobana, alama za vipimo za kufuatilia kiasi cha mkojo na mshiko ambao mkono dhaifu unaweza kushika. Mwaga na suuza baada ya kila matumizi na safisha kila siku kwa maji ya moto yenye sabuni na dawa ya kuua vijidudu iliyochanganywa."],["Simple, inexpensive item that prevents night falls; natural add-on to bed and continence purchases","Kifaa rahisi na cha bei nafuu kinachozuia kuanguka usiku; nyongeza ya asili kwa ununuzi wa vifaa vya kitanda na mkojo"]],"sn_cont_bedpan":[["A bedpan lets a bed-bound person open their bowels or pass urine lying down. Contoured, slipper-shaped designs with a low front edge are easier to slide under the hips and press less on fragile skin than round hospital pans. Warm the rim with water, sprinkle a little powder or place an underpad beneath, and raise the head of the bed slightly to make use more natural. Empty into the toilet, rinse and disinfect after each use. Use a bedpan only when getting to a commode is unsafe, because sitting upright empties the bowel more completely and preserves strength.","Chombo cha haja kitandani humwezesha mtu aliye kitandani kujisaidia haja kubwa au ndogo akiwa amelala. Miundo yenye umbo la kiatu na ukingo wa mbele ulio chini ni rahisi kuingiza chini ya nyonga na hubana ngozi dhaifu kidogo kuliko vyombo vya duara vya hospitali. Pasha ukingo kwa maji ya uvuguvugu, weka pedi ya kutandika chini yake, na inua kichwa cha kitanda kidogo ili kujisaidia kuwe kwa kawaida zaidi. Mwaga chooni, suuza na safisha kwa dawa baada ya kila matumizi. Tumia chombo hiki pale tu kufika kwenye kiti cha choo si salama, kwa sababu kukaa wima husaidia tumbo kujisafisha kikamilifu na hulinda nguvu za mwili."],["Essential for home-based bed care with few local retail options; strengthens Afya's caregiver credibility","Muhimu kwa huduma ya kitandani nyumbani ambapo maduka ni machache; huimarisha uaminifu wa Afya kwa walezi"]],"sn_cont_bags":[["Used continence products should be rolled tightly, sealed in a bag and placed in a lidded bin, never burnt indoors or flushed. Draw-tape pedal-bin liners close with one pull, which helps a carer with full hands; heavy-duty large bags take the day's waste out to collection. Double-bag anything soiled with stool and wash hands afterwards. A household changing four briefs a day fills roughly one small liner a day. Good disposal keeps the room fresh, which matters greatly for the dignity of the older person and for visitors.","Bidhaa za mkojo zilizotumika zinapaswa kukunjwa kwa kubana, kufungwa ndani ya mfuko na kuwekwa kwenye pipa lenye mfuniko, kamwe zisichomwe ndani ya nyumba wala kutupwa chooni. Mifuko ya pipa yenye kamba hufungwa kwa kuvuta mara moja, jambo linalomsaidia mlezi mwenye mikono iliyojaa; mifuko mikubwa imara hupeleka taka za siku nzima kwenye eneo la kukusanyia. Tumia mifuko miwili kwa chochote chenye choo na nawa mikono baadaye. Kaya inayobadilisha nepi nne kwa siku hujaza takriban mfuko mmoja mdogo kwa siku. Utupaji mzuri huweka chumba kikiwa na harufu safi, jambo muhimu sana kwa heshima ya mzee na kwa wageni."],["Cheap, consumable add-on that solves the odour problem families worry about most","Nyongeza ya bei nafuu inayotatua tatizo la harufu linalowasumbua familia zaidi"]],"sn_cont_tissue":[["Older skin around the bottom is thin and easily scratched, so soft, two-ply tissue reduces soreness, especially for people with haemorrhoids, diarrhoea or frequent toileting. Choose plain white, unperfumed rolls; dyes and perfumes can irritate. Pat rather than rub, and use a damp adult wipe if stool is sticky. A home caring for an older person uses noticeably more tissue than average, around 10–20 rolls a month. Afya stocks a value single roll and multi-packs so the household can buy with the monthly box.","Ngozi ya makalio ya wazee ni nyembamba na hukwaruzika kwa urahisi, kwa hiyo karatasi laini ya tabaka mbili hupunguza michubuko, hasa kwa watu wenye bawasiri, kuhara au kwenda chooni mara kwa mara. Chagua roli nyeupe zisizo na marashi; rangi na marashi vinaweza kuwasha ngozi. Gusagusa badala ya kusugua, na tumia wipe ya mtu mzima yenye unyevu ikiwa choo kinanata. Nyumba inayomhudumia mzee hutumia karatasi nyingi kuliko kawaida, takriban roli 10–20 kwa mwezi. Afya ina roli moja ya bei nafuu na pakiti za roli nyingi ili kaya inunue pamoja na boksi la kila mwezi."],["Everyday staple that keeps the senior shopper's whole basket at Afya","Bidhaa ya kila siku inayomfanya mnunuzi wa mzee anunue kikapu chake chote Afya"]],"sn_skin_lotion":[["After 60 the skin produces less oil and holds less water, so dryness, itching and fine cracking on the shins and arms are very common. A good lotion contains humectants such as glycerin plus oils or shea butter to seal water in. Apply within three minutes of bathing, while skin is still slightly damp, and again at night; a 400 ml bottle lasts about a month for one person. Choose fragrance-light products and avoid lotions with skin-lightening agents. Regular moisturising prevents the scratching that leads to skin tears and infection.","Baada ya miaka 60 ngozi hutoa mafuta kidogo na hushikilia maji kidogo, kwa hiyo ukavu, muwasho na mipasuko midogo kwenye miundi na mikono ni jambo la kawaida sana. Losheni nzuri ina viambato vinavyovuta maji kama glycerin pamoja na mafuta au siagi ya shea ili kufungia maji ndani. Paka ndani ya dakika tatu baada ya kuoga, ngozi ikiwa bado na unyevu kidogo, na tena usiku; chupa ya mililita 400 hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja kwa mtu mmoja. Chagua bidhaa zenye harufu hafifu na epuka losheni zenye viambato vya kung'arisha ngozi. Kulainisha mara kwa mara huzuia kujikuna kunakosababisha michubuko na maambukizi."],["Large, fast-moving household staple; the entry point for the whole senior skin range","Bidhaa kuu ya nyumbani inayouzika haraka; mlango wa kuingia kwa bidhaa zote za ngozi za wazee"]],"sn_skin_urea":[["Urea is a natural moisturising factor that draws water into the outer skin and gently loosens scale, so 5–10% urea lotions work well on rough shins, elbows and the \"crazy-paving\" dryness common in older people and people with diabetes. They may sting on broken or cracked skin for a few minutes; if stinging persists, use a plain emollient until it heals. Apply once or twice daily after washing. A 250 ml bottle lasts four to six weeks. Persistent itch without visible rash can signal kidney, liver or thyroid problems and should be checked.","Urea ni kilainishi asilia kinachovuta maji kwenye tabaka la juu la ngozi na kulegeza magamba taratibu, kwa hiyo losheni zenye urea asilimia 5–10 hufanya kazi vizuri kwenye miundi mikavu, viwiko na ukavu wenye mipasuko kama sakafu ya vigae unaowapata wazee na watu wenye kisukari. Zinaweza kuwasha kwa dakika chache kwenye ngozi iliyopasuka; muwasho ukiendelea, tumia kilainishi cha kawaida hadi ngozi ipone. Paka mara moja au mbili kwa siku baada ya kuoga. Chupa ya mililita 250 hudumu wiki nne hadi sita. Muwasho unaoendelea bila upele unaoonekana unaweza kuashiria matatizo ya figo, ini au tezi na unapaswa kuchunguzwa."],["Dermatologist-grade solution with high value per unit and strong pharmacist recommendation","Suluhisho la kiwango cha madaktari wa ngozi lenye thamani kubwa kwa kila bidhaa na linalopendekezwa sana na wafamasia"]],"sn_skin_cream":[["Creams are thicker than lotions and contain more oil, so they seal moisture in for longer and suit hands, shins and feet that crack in the dry season. Ceramide creams help rebuild the skin barrier, which weakens with age. Scoop with a clean spoon or spatula rather than fingers to keep the tub clean. Use at night or after bathing; a 450 g tub lasts six to eight weeks. Creams are the backbone of care for dry-skin conditions recommended by dermatologists and are safe for daily long-term use.","Krimu ni nzito kuliko losheni na zina mafuta mengi zaidi, kwa hiyo hufungia unyevu kwa muda mrefu na zinafaa kwa mikono, miundi na miguu inayopasuka wakati wa ukame. Krimu zenye ceramide husaidia kujenga upya kinga ya ngozi, ambayo hudhoofika kwa umri. Chota kwa kijiko safi badala ya vidole ili kuweka chombo kikiwa safi. Tumia usiku au baada ya kuoga; chombo cha gramu 450 hudumu wiki sita hadi nane. Krimu hizi ndizo msingi wa huduma ya ngozi kavu inayopendekezwa na madaktari wa ngozi na ni salama kwa matumizi ya kila siku kwa muda mrefu."],["Premium tubs with strong margin and high loyalty once a customer sees results","Vyombo vya hali ya juu vyenye faida kubwa na uaminifu mkubwa mara mteja anapoona matokeo"]],"sn_skin_wash":[["Ordinary bar soaps are alkaline and remove the skin's protective oils, worsening dryness and itch. Soap-free syndet bars, cream washes and shower creams clean effectively at a skin-friendly pH. Use lukewarm rather than hot water, keep baths short and pat dry, paying attention to skin folds and between the toes. One 400–500 ml bottle lasts a person about a month. Switching from harsh soap to a gentle wash is often the single most effective change for an older person with itchy skin.","Sabuni za kawaida za kipande zina alkali na huondoa mafuta yanayolinda ngozi, hivyo kuongeza ukavu na muwasho. Vipande visivyo vya sabuni, sabuni za maji zenye krimu na krimu za kuogea husafisha vizuri kwa kiwango cha asidi kinachofaa ngozi. Tumia maji ya uvuguvugu badala ya moto, oga kwa muda mfupi na kausha kwa kugusagusa, ukizingatia mikunjo ya ngozi na kati ya vidole vya miguu. Chupa moja ya mililita 400–500 hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja kwa mtu mmoja. Kubadili kutoka sabuni kali kwenda sabuni laini mara nyingi ndiyo hatua moja yenye matokeo makubwa kwa mzee mwenye ngozi inayowasha."],["Simple swap with immediate comfort benefit; repeat monthly purchase across all price points","Mabadiliko rahisi yenye faraja ya haraka; ununuzi wa kila mwezi katika viwango vyote vya bei"]],"sn_skin_petro":[["Pure petroleum jelly is one of the most effective and affordable occlusive moisturisers: it forms a film that cuts water loss from the skin by up to 99%. Use a thin layer over damp skin, on cracked heels under socks at night, on dry lips and as a simple barrier in skin folds. It contains no fragrance or preservatives, so it rarely irritates. Never use it near oxygen equipment or on fresh burns. A 100 ml tub lasts a month or more for spot use.","Mafuta safi ya petroli ni mojawapo ya vilainishi bora na nafuu vinavyofunika ngozi: huunda tabaka linalopunguza upotevu wa maji kutoka ngozini kwa hadi asilimia 99. Paka safu nyembamba juu ya ngozi yenye unyevu, kwenye visigino vilivyopasuka chini ya soksi usiku, kwenye midomo mikavu na kama kinga rahisi kwenye mikunjo ya ngozi. Hayana manukato wala vihifadhi, kwa hiyo mara chache huwasha. Usitumie karibu na vifaa vya oksijeni wala kwenye majeraha mapya ya moto. Chombo cha mililita 100 hudumu mwezi mmoja au zaidi kwa matumizi ya sehemu ndogo."],["Trusted, very low-cost multipurpose product that every Tanzanian home recognises","Bidhaa ya matumizi mengi inayoaminika na yenye bei nafuu sana inayojulikana na kila nyumba ya Kitanzania"]],"sn_skin_hand":[["Older people and their carers wash hands many times a day, and alcohol rub removes skin oils, so hands crack and become painful. Hand creams absorb quickly so the person can carry on with daily tasks; ceramide or glycerin formulas repair fastest. Apply after each wash and especially at bedtime. A 50–60 g tube lasts two to four weeks. Healthy, unbroken skin on the hands is also an infection-control measure, because cracks harbour germs.","Wazee na walezi wao hunawa mikono mara nyingi kwa siku, na vitakasa vyenye pombe huondoa mafuta ya ngozi, hivyo mikono hupasuka na kuuma. Krimu za mikono hufyonzwa haraka ili mtu aendelee na shughuli za kila siku; zenye ceramide au glycerin hurekebisha ngozi kwa haraka zaidi. Paka baada ya kila kunawa na hasa wakati wa kulala. Tyubu ya gramu 50–60 hudumu wiki mbili hadi nne. Ngozi ya mikono iliyo salama bila mipasuko pia ni njia ya kuzuia maambukizi, kwa sababu mipasuko huhifadhi vijidudu."],["Small, giftable item with good margin; pairs with every sanitiser and glove sale","Bidhaa ndogo inayofaa kama zawadi yenye faida nzuri; huenda pamoja na kila mauzo ya vitakasa na glavu"]],"sn_skin_lip":[["Lips dry out quickly in older people, especially those who breathe through the mouth, take medicines that dry the mouth or are unwell in bed. A balm with petrolatum, shea or beeswax seals moisture; balms with SPF protect against sun outdoors. Apply several times a day and before sleep. Cracks at the corners of the mouth that do not heal can indicate ill-fitting dentures, thrush or vitamin deficiency and should be checked. One stick or tin lasts about a month.","Midomo ya wazee hukauka haraka, hasa kwa wanaopumua kwa mdomo, wanaotumia dawa zinazokausha kinywa au walio wagonjwa kitandani. Mafuta yenye petrolatum, shea au nta ya nyuki hufungia unyevu; yale yenye kinga ya jua hulinda yakiwa nje. Paka mara kadhaa kwa siku na kabla ya kulala. Mipasuko kwenye pembe za mdomo isiyopona inaweza kuashiria meno bandia yasiyokaa vizuri, fangasi au upungufu wa vitamini na inapaswa kuchunguzwa. Kijiti kimoja au kibati kimoja hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja."],["Low-price impulse buy placed at the till; frequent repeat","Bidhaa ya bei ndogo ya kununua kwa ghafla inayowekwa kaunta; hurudiwa mara kwa mara"]],"sn_skin_itch":[["Calamine lotion cools and calms itchy skin and is a safe first step for heat rash, mild allergic rashes and bites. Shake well, dab on with cotton wool and let dry; it can dry the skin, so follow with a moisturiser once the itch settles. Because itch in older people is often caused by dryness, a moisturiser is the long-term answer. Itch that spreads, keeps the person awake, or comes with blisters, fever or yellow skin needs a health worker. A 100 ml bottle lasts several weeks.","Losheni ya calamine hupoza na kutuliza ngozi inayowasha na ni hatua ya kwanza salama kwa vipele vya joto, vipele vidogo vya mzio na kuumwa na wadudu. Tikisa vizuri, paka kwa pamba na iache ikauke; inaweza kukausha ngozi, kwa hiyo fuatisha kilainishi muwasho unapotulia. Kwa sababu muwasho kwa wazee mara nyingi husababishwa na ukavu, kilainishi ndicho suluhisho la muda mrefu. Muwasho unaosambaa, unaomkosesha mtu usingizi, au unaoambatana na malengelenge, homa au ngozi ya manjano unahitaji mhudumu wa afya. Chupa ya mililita 100 hudumu wiki kadhaa."],["Cheap, familiar remedy with seasonal peaks in the hot months","Dawa ya bei nafuu inayojulikana yenye mauzo makubwa wakati wa joto"]],"sn_skin_sun":[["Decades of sun exposure thin the skin and raise the risk of skin cancer, and some common medicines for blood pressure and infections make the skin burn more easily. People with albinism need daily sunscreen throughout life. Choose broad-spectrum SPF 30 or higher, apply generously to the face, ears, neck and hands 15 minutes before going out and reapply every two hours. Pair with a wide-brimmed hat and shade between 10 am and 4 pm. A 200 ml bottle lasts about a month for daily face and arm use.","Miaka mingi ya kupigwa na jua hufanya ngozi kuwa nyembamba na huongeza hatari ya saratani ya ngozi, na baadhi ya dawa za kawaida za shinikizo la damu na maambukizi hufanya ngozi iungue kwa urahisi zaidi. Watu wenye ualbino wanahitaji kinga ya jua kila siku maisha yao yote. Chagua kinga ya wigo mpana yenye SPF 30 au zaidi, paka kwa wingi usoni, masikioni, shingoni na mikononi dakika 15 kabla ya kutoka na paka tena kila baada ya saa mbili. Ambatanisha na kofia pana na kivuli kati ya saa nne asubuhi na saa kumi jioni. Chupa ya mililita 200 hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja kwa matumizi ya kila siku usoni na mikononi."],["Fills a real protective gap for vulnerable groups; premium price point with seasonal lift","Hujaza pengo halisi la kinga kwa makundi yaliyo hatarini; bei ya juu yenye ongezeko la msimu"]],"sn_oral_dclean":[["Dentures collect plaque, food and fungus just like natural teeth, and dirty dentures cause bad breath, gum soreness and denture stomatitis. Brush the denture first, then soak it in lukewarm (never hot) water with one effervescent tablet for the time on the pack, and rinse well before wearing. Tablets reach areas a brush misses and are gentler than bleach or toothpaste, which scratch acrylic. One tablet a day means a 30-tablet pack lasts a month. Leaving dentures out overnight in a clean box lets the gums rest.","Meno bandia hukusanya utando, mabaki ya chakula na fangasi kama meno ya asili, na meno bandia machafu husababisha harufu mbaya ya kinywa, maumivu ya fizi na uvimbe chini ya meno bandia. Piga mswaki meno bandia kwanza, kisha loweka kwenye maji ya uvuguvugu (kamwe si ya moto) pamoja na kidonge kimoja kinachochemka kwa muda ulioandikwa kwenye pakiti, na suuza vizuri kabla ya kuvaa. Vidonge hufika sehemu ambazo mswaki haufiki na ni laini kuliko dawa ya kusafishia nguo au dawa ya meno, ambazo hukwaruza plastiki ya meno. Kidonge kimoja kwa siku humaanisha pakiti ya vidonge 30 hudumu mwezi mmoja. Kuacha meno bandia nje usiku ndani ya kisanduku safi huzipa fizi nafasi ya kupumzika."],["Monthly repeat purchase with few local competitors; anchors the denture shelf","Ununuzi wa kurudiwa kila mwezi wenye washindani wachache wa ndani; kiini cha rafu ya meno bandia"]],"sn_oral_dfix":[["A small amount of adhesive cream improves the hold and comfort of well-made dentures, keeps food from slipping underneath and gives confidence when eating and speaking. Use three pea-sized dots on a clean, dry denture; more is not better and excess oozes out. Remove all adhesive daily from the denture and gums. If a person needs more and more adhesive, the denture probably no longer fits, because gums shrink with age, and a dental check is needed. A 40 g tube lasts three to six weeks.","Kiasi kidogo cha gundi ya krimu huboresha ushikaji na starehe ya meno bandia yaliyotengenezwa vizuri, huzuia chakula kuingia chini yake na humpa mtu ujasiri wa kula na kuongea. Tumia vitone vitatu vyenye ukubwa wa punje ya njegere kwenye meno bandia safi na makavu; zaidi si bora na gundi ya ziada hutoka nje. Ondoa gundi yote kila siku kutoka kwenye meno bandia na fizi. Ikiwa mtu anahitaji gundi zaidi na zaidi, huenda meno bandia hayamkai tena, kwa sababu fizi husinyaa kwa umri, na anahitaji kuchunguzwa na daktari wa meno. Tyubu ya gramu 40 hudumu wiki tatu hadi sita."],["Restores confidence at meals; trusted brands with repeat purchase and healthy margin","Hurejesha ujasiri wakati wa kula; chapa zinazoaminika zenye ununuzi wa kurudiwa na faida nzuri"]],"sn_oral_dbox":[["Dentures are costly to replace and are often lost or broken when wrapped in tissue, left on trays or dropped. A lidded denture box keeps them in water or soaking solution, away from children and pets, and is easy to label with the owner's name for hospital stays. Choose one with a drainage basket so the denture can be lifted out without touching the soaking liquid. Wash the box daily and replace it every few months. It is a small, inexpensive item that prevents a very expensive loss.","Meno bandia ni ghali kubadilisha na mara nyingi hupotea au huvunjika yanapofungwa kwenye karatasi, kuachwa kwenye sinia au kuanguka. Kisanduku chenye mfuniko huyaweka ndani ya maji au dawa ya kuloweka, mbali na watoto na wanyama, na ni rahisi kuandika jina la mwenyewe anapolazwa hospitalini. Chagua chenye kikapu cha kutolea maji ili meno bandia yainuliwe bila kugusa kioevu cha kuloweka. Osha kisanduku kila siku na kibadilishe baada ya miezi michache. Ni kifaa kidogo cha bei nafuu kinachozuia hasara kubwa sana."],["Inexpensive add-on that sells with every first denture purchase","Nyongeza ya bei nafuu inayouzwa pamoja na kila ununuzi wa kwanza wa vifaa vya meno bandia"]],"sn_oral_dbrush":[["A denture brush has a large, firm head for the outer surfaces and a small angled head for the inside curve and clasps of partial dentures. Brushing removes sticky plaque that soaking alone cannot. Brush over a basin filled with water or a folded towel so the denture does not break if dropped, and use plain soap or denture cleanser rather than toothpaste. Replace the brush every three months. The person's own gums, tongue and any remaining teeth should be brushed separately with a soft toothbrush.","Mswaki wa meno bandia una kichwa kikubwa kigumu kwa nyuso za nje na kichwa kidogo kilichoinama kwa upande wa ndani na vibanio vya meno bandia ya sehemu. Kupiga mswaki huondoa utando unaonata ambao kuloweka peke yake hakuuondoi. Piga mswaki juu ya beseni lenye maji au taulo iliyokunjwa ili meno bandia yasivunjike yakianguka, na tumia sabuni ya kawaida au dawa ya kusafishia meno bandia badala ya dawa ya meno. Badilisha mswaki kila baada ya miezi mitatu. Fizi, ulimi na meno yoyote ya asili yaliyobaki yanapaswa kupigwa mswaki kando kwa mswaki laini."],["Completes the denture routine; low-cost item with quarterly repeat","Hukamilisha utaratibu wa meno bandia; bidhaa ya bei ndogo inayorudiwa kila robo mwaka"]],"sn_oral_sens":[["Gums recede with age and expose the softer root surface, so many older people feel a sharp twinge with cold drinks or brushing. Sensitive toothpastes contain potassium nitrate, stannous fluoride or arginine that calm the nerve or seal the tiny tubes in the root, plus fluoride that also prevents root decay. Use twice daily with a soft brush, spit but do not rinse, and allow two to four weeks for full effect. One 75 ml tube lasts about a month. Pain that lingers, wakes the person or comes with swelling needs a dentist.","Fizi hurudi nyuma kwa umri na kuacha wazi sehemu laini ya mzizi, kwa hiyo wazee wengi huhisi uchungu mkali wanapokunywa vinywaji baridi au kupiga mswaki. Dawa za meno nyeti zina potassium nitrate, stannous fluoride au arginine zinazotuliza neva au kuziba mirija midogo kwenye mzizi, pamoja na fluoride inayozuia pia kuoza kwa mizizi. Tumia mara mbili kwa siku kwa mswaki laini, tema lakini usisuuze, na subiri wiki mbili hadi nne kupata matokeo kamili. Tyubu moja ya mililita 75 hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja. Maumivu yanayoendelea, yanayomwamsha mtu usingizini au yanayoambatana na uvimbe yanahitaji daktari wa meno."],["High-repeat, brand-loyal category; easy recommendation that builds trust at the counter","Aina ya bidhaa yenye kurudiwa sana na uaminifu wa chapa; pendekezo rahisi linalojenga imani kaunta"]],"sn_oral_soft":[["Hard bristles and heavy scrubbing wear away gums and exposed roots, worsening sensitivity. A soft or extra-soft brush with a small head cleans the gum line gently and reaches back teeth. Hold it like a pen to reduce pressure, brush for two minutes twice a day and replace every three months or when bristles splay. A thick, non-slip handle helps people with arthritis. Remaining natural teeth matter greatly in old age because they support chewing, nutrition and denture stability.","Nyuzi ngumu na kusugua kwa nguvu humomonyoa fizi na mizizi iliyo wazi, hivyo kuongeza unyeti. Mswaki laini au laini sana wenye kichwa kidogo husafisha mpaka wa fizi kwa upole na hufika meno ya nyuma. Ushike kama kalamu ili kupunguza nguvu, piga mswaki kwa dakika mbili mara mbili kwa siku na ubadilishe kila baada ya miezi mitatu au nyuzi zinapotawanyika. Mpini mnene usioteleza huwasaidia watu wenye baridi yabisi. Meno ya asili yaliyobaki ni muhimu sana uzeeni kwa sababu husaidia kutafuna, lishe na uthabiti wa meno bandia."],["Everyday essential across all price levels; frequent replacement drives footfall","Bidhaa muhimu ya kila siku katika viwango vyote vya bei; kubadilisha mara kwa mara huleta wateja dukani"]],"sn_oral_power":[["A battery or rechargeable toothbrush does the brushing movement for the user, so a person with stiff fingers only has to guide it along the teeth. Research shows oscillating-rotating brushes remove more plaque and reduce gum inflammation more than manual brushing. The thicker handle is easier to grip, and timers help carers brush for a full two minutes. Replace heads every three months. They are also useful for carers brushing someone else's teeth.","Mswaki wa betri au unaochajiwa hufanya mzunguko wa kusugua kwa niaba ya mtumiaji, kwa hiyo mtu mwenye vidole vigumu anahitaji tu kuuongoza kando ya meno. Utafiti unaonyesha miswaki inayozunguka huondoa utando zaidi na hupunguza uvimbe wa fizi kuliko kupiga mswaki kwa mkono. Mpini wake mnene ni rahisi kushika, na saa ya ndani huwasaidia walezi kupiga mswaki kwa dakika mbili kamili. Badilisha vichwa kila baada ya miezi mitatu. Pia ni muhimu kwa walezi wanaompigia mtu mwingine mswaki."],["Higher-ticket, giftable item that solves a real dexterity problem","Bidhaa ya bei ya juu inayofaa kama zawadi inayotatua tatizo halisi la ushikaji"]],"sn_oral_inter":[["Gaps between teeth widen with age, trapping food that causes gum disease and root decay. Interdental brushes are small bottle-brushes that fit these gaps and are easier for older hands than floss; choose the size that fits snugly without forcing. Waxed floss suits tight contacts. Clean once a day, ideally at night. Bleeding at first usually settles within two weeks as gums heal; persistent bleeding needs a dentist.","Mianya kati ya meno hupanuka kwa umri na kunasa chakula kinachosababisha ugonjwa wa fizi na kuoza kwa mizizi. Miswaki ya katikati ya meno ni miswaki midogo inayoingia kwenye mianya hii na ni rahisi kwa mikono ya wazee kuliko uzi; chagua saizi inayoingia vizuri bila kulazimisha. Uzi wenye nta unafaa kwa meno yaliyobanana. Safisha mara moja kwa siku, ikiwezekana usiku. Kutoka damu mwanzoni kwa kawaida hupungua ndani ya wiki mbili fizi zinapopona; damu inayoendelea inahitaji daktari wa meno."],["Professional-grade product that positions Afya as a serious oral-care destination","Bidhaa ya kiwango cha kitaalamu inayoiweka Afya kama kituo makini cha utunzaji wa kinywa"]],"sn_oral_dry":[["More than 400 common medicines, including those for blood pressure, depression and bladder control, reduce saliva, and older people often take several at once. A dry mouth makes chewing, swallowing, speaking and wearing dentures difficult and sharply raises the risk of tooth decay and thrush. Saliva-replacement gels coat and moisten the mouth for hours; apply to the tongue and gums, especially at night. Sip water often, chew sugar-free gum and avoid alcohol-based mouthwashes. Ask a pharmacist to review medicines if dry mouth is severe.","Zaidi ya dawa 400 za kawaida, zikiwemo za shinikizo la damu, sonona na kudhibiti kibofu, hupunguza mate, na wazee mara nyingi hutumia kadhaa kwa wakati mmoja. Kinywa kikavu hufanya kutafuna, kumeza, kuongea na kuvaa meno bandia kuwa vigumu na huongeza sana hatari ya kuoza kwa meno na fangasi. Jeli za kubadilisha mate hufunika na kulowesha kinywa kwa saa kadhaa; paka kwenye ulimi na fizi, hasa usiku. Kunywa maji kidogo kidogo mara kwa mara, tafuna jojo isiyo na sukari na epuka dawa za kusukutua zenye pombe. Mwombe mfamasia akague dawa ikiwa ukavu ni mkubwa."],["Specialist product few shops stock; high value and strong pharmacist-led loyalty","Bidhaa maalum ambayo maduka machache huwa nayo; thamani kubwa na uaminifu unaojengwa na mfamasia"]],"sn_oral_rinse":[["Alcohol-free fluoride mouthwash adds protection against root decay, which is common in older adults, and freshens breath without drying the mouth. Use at a different time from brushing, for example after lunch, so the toothpaste fluoride is not rinsed away. Swish for 30–60 seconds and do not swallow; people with swallowing difficulty may use a moistened sponge swab instead. A 250 ml bottle lasts two to four weeks. Persistent bad breath despite good cleaning can signal gum disease or other illness.","Dawa ya kusukutua yenye fluoride isiyo na pombe huongeza kinga dhidi ya kuoza kwa mizizi ya meno, jambo la kawaida kwa wazee, na husafisha pumzi bila kukausha kinywa. Itumie wakati tofauti na kupiga mswaki, kwa mfano baada ya chakula cha mchana, ili fluoride ya dawa ya meno isisuuzwe. Sukutua kwa sekunde 30–60 na usimeze; watu wenye shida ya kumeza wanaweza kutumia sponji ndogo iliyolowanishwa badala yake. Chupa ya mililita 250 hudumu wiki mbili hadi nne. Harufu mbaya ya kinywa inayoendelea licha ya usafi mzuri inaweza kuashiria ugonjwa wa fizi au magonjwa mengine."],["Steady add-on to toothpaste purchases with good margin","Nyongeza thabiti kwa ununuzi wa dawa za meno yenye faida nzuri"]],"sn_sens_hab":[["Most hearing aids run on small zinc-air \"button\" batteries coded by size and tab colour: 312 (brown), 13 (orange), 675 (blue) and 10 (yellow). They activate when the sticker is removed, so peel it off and wait one minute before inserting. A battery lasts three to ten days depending on size and use, so a regular user needs about 4–8 a month. Store at room temperature, away from coins and keys, and keep well out of reach of children and pets: swallowed button batteries are a medical emergency. Hard-to-find batteries are a common reason older people stop wearing their aids, which worsens isolation and is linked to faster memory decline.","Vifaa vingi vya kusikia hutumia betri ndogo za zinc-air zenye umbo la kifungo zilizowekwa alama kwa saizi na rangi ya kibandiko: 312 (kahawia), 13 (rangi ya chungwa), 675 (bluu) na 10 (njano). Huanza kufanya kazi kibandiko kinapoondolewa, kwa hiyo kibandue na subiri dakika moja kabla ya kuweka. Betri hudumu siku tatu hadi kumi kulingana na saizi na matumizi, kwa hiyo mtumiaji wa kawaida huhitaji takriban 4–8 kwa mwezi. Hifadhi kwenye joto la kawaida, mbali na sarafu na funguo, na weka mbali kabisa na watoto na wanyama: betri ya kifungo ikimezwa ni dharura ya kitabibu. Betri zisizopatikana kwa urahisi ni sababu ya kawaida ya wazee kuacha kuvaa vifaa vyao, jambo linaloongeza upweke na linalohusishwa na kupungua kwa kumbukumbu kwa kasi."],["Hard to find locally; guarantees monthly return visits from hearing-aid users","Ni vigumu kupatikana nchini; huhakikisha watumiaji wa vifaa vya kusikia wanarudi kila mwezi"]],"sn_sens_wax":[["Ear wax becomes drier and harder with age, and hearing-aid moulds push it deeper, so blocked ears are a very common, reversible cause of poor hearing in older people. Softening drops based on sodium bicarbonate, olive oil or urea hydrogen peroxide loosen wax so it works out naturally. Warm the bottle in the hand, tilt the head and put drops in once or twice daily for three to five days. Never use cotton buds, hairpins or ear candles. Do not use drops if there is ear pain, discharge, a perforated eardrum or a grommet, and see a health worker if hearing does not improve.","Nta ya sikio huwa kavu na ngumu zaidi kwa umri, na vifaa vya kusikia huisukuma ndani zaidi, kwa hiyo masikio yaliyoziba ni sababu ya kawaida sana na inayorekebishika ya kutosikia vizuri kwa wazee. Matone ya kulainisha yenye sodium bicarbonate, mafuta ya zeituni au urea hydrogen peroxide hulegeza nta ili itoke yenyewe. Pasha chupa kwa kuishika mkononi, inamisha kichwa na weka matone mara moja au mbili kwa siku kwa siku tatu hadi tano. Kamwe usitumie vijiti vya pamba, pini za nywele wala mishumaa ya masikio. Usitumie matone ikiwa kuna maumivu ya sikio, usaha, ngoma ya sikio iliyotoboka au mrija sikioni, na mwone mhudumu wa afya ikiwa usikivu hauboreki."],["Cheap, effective fix for a common complaint; builds trust as a first-line answer","Suluhisho la bei nafuu na lenye ufanisi kwa tatizo la kawaida; hujenga imani kama jibu la kwanza"]],"sn_sens_readers":[["From around 40 the eye's lens stiffens (presbyopia), so near print blurs; ready-made readers in strengths from +1.00 to +3.50 restore near vision for most people. Choose the lowest strength that makes normal print clear at a comfortable 35–40 cm, and test both eyes. Readers are for close work only and are not a substitute for an eye test: an older person should have a full eye check every one to two years to detect cataract, glaucoma and diabetic eye disease, which readers cannot correct. Keep a spare pair in the kitchen and by the bed.","Kuanzia takriban miaka 40 lenzi ya jicho hukakamaa (presbyopia), hivyo maandishi ya karibu huwa na ukungu; miwani ya kusomea iliyo tayari yenye nguvu kuanzia +1.00 hadi +3.50 hurejesha uwezo wa kuona karibu kwa watu wengi. Chagua nguvu ya chini kabisa inayofanya maandishi ya kawaida yaonekane wazi kwa umbali wa starehe wa sentimita 35–40, na pima macho yote mawili. Miwani hii ni kwa kazi za karibu tu na si mbadala wa kupimwa macho: mzee anapaswa kupimwa macho kikamilifu kila baada ya mwaka mmoja hadi miwili ili kugundua mtoto wa jicho, glaukoma na ugonjwa wa macho wa kisukari, ambavyo miwani ya kusomea haiwezi kurekebisha. Weka jozi ya ziada jikoni na kando ya kitanda."],["Huge unmet need at very low price; frequent multiple-pair purchases","Hitaji kubwa lisilotimizwa kwa bei ndogo sana; mara nyingi hununuliwa jozi kadhaa"]],"sn_sens_magnifier":[["Magnifiers enlarge print for people whose sight cannot be fully corrected with glasses, for example after macular degeneration, glaucoma or diabetic eye disease. A 3×–4× lens suits general reading; stronger lenses suit small print but show less of the page. Built-in LED light greatly improves contrast, which declines with age. Hold the lens close to the eye and move the text, or rest a stand magnifier on the page for steady hands. They help older people read their own medicine labels, a key safety and independence issue.","Lenzi kuza hukuza maandishi kwa watu ambao uoni wao hauwezi kurekebishwa kikamilifu kwa miwani, kwa mfano baada ya kuharibika kwa sehemu ya kati ya retina, glaukoma au ugonjwa wa macho wa kisukari. Lenzi ya 3×–4× inafaa kwa kusoma kwa ujumla; lenzi zenye nguvu zaidi zinafaa kwa maandishi madogo lakini huonyesha sehemu ndogo ya ukurasa. Taa ya LED iliyojengwa ndani huongeza sana utofautishaji, ambao hupungua kwa umri. Shika lenzi karibu na jicho na usogeze maandishi, au weka lenzi yenye kisimamo juu ya ukurasa kwa wenye mikono inayotetemeka. Huwasaidia wazee kusoma lebo za dawa zao wenyewe, jambo muhimu kwa usalama na kujitegemea."],["Practical, giftable aid with good margin and few local competitors","Kifaa cha vitendo kinachofaa kama zawadi chenye faida nzuri na washindani wachache wa ndani"]],"sn_sens_tears":[["Tear production falls with age, and dry eye is one of the most common eye complaints in older adults; paradoxically it can also cause watering. Artificial tears based on carmellose, hypromellose or hyaluronate soothe and protect the eye surface. Use one or two drops up to four times a day; preservative-free types are better for frequent use. Do not let the tip touch the eye and discard opened bottles after the time on the label, usually 28 days. A red, painful eye, sudden blurred vision or light sensitivity is an emergency and needs an eye clinic, not drops.","Utoaji wa machozi hupungua kwa umri, na macho makavu ni mojawapo ya malalamiko ya kawaida zaidi ya macho kwa wazee; cha kushangaza ni kwamba yanaweza pia kusababisha macho kutoa machozi. Machozi bandia yenye carmellose, hypromellose au hyaluronate hutuliza na kulinda uso wa jicho. Tumia tone moja au mawili hadi mara nne kwa siku; aina zisizo na vihifadhi ni bora kwa matumizi ya mara kwa mara. Usiruhusu ncha iguse jicho na tupa chupa zilizofunguliwa baada ya muda ulioandikwa kwenye lebo, kwa kawaida siku 28. Jicho jekundu lenye maumivu, kuona ukungu ghafla au kuumizwa na mwanga ni dharura na kunahitaji kliniki ya macho, si matone."],["Steady pharmacy-grade repeat purchase that complements readers and magnifiers","Ununuzi thabiti wa kiwango cha famasia unaorudiwa na unaokamilisha miwani na lenzi kuza"]],"sn_sens_eyewash":[["Sterile eye washes gently flush out dust and pollen, which is useful in the dry, dusty months and after travel. Fill the eye bath, lean forward, open and close the eye several times, then discard the liquid and rinse the cup. Use only products labelled for the eye, never tap water in the cup after opening, and stop if irritation increases. Chemical splashes need immediate flushing with large amounts of clean water and urgent care. One bottle lasts several weeks of occasional use.","Dawa safi za kuoshea macho huondoa kwa upole vumbi na chavua, jambo lenye manufaa wakati wa miezi mikavu yenye vumbi na baada ya safari. Jaza kikombe cha kuoshea macho, inama mbele, fungua na funga jicho mara kadhaa, kisha mwaga kioevu na suuza kikombe. Tumia bidhaa zilizoandikwa kwa matumizi ya macho tu, usitumie maji ya bomba kwenye kikombe baada ya kufungua, na acha ikiwa muwasho unaongezeka. Kumwagikiwa na kemikali kunahitaji kuosha mara moja kwa maji mengi safi na huduma ya haraka. Chupa moja hudumu wiki kadhaa kwa matumizi ya mara kwa mara."],["Premium comfort product with seasonal dust-season peak","Bidhaa ya faraja ya hali ya juu yenye mauzo makubwa msimu wa vumbi"]],"sn_sens_lenscare":[["Smudged or scratched lenses reduce contrast and make poor vision worse, and many older people clean glasses on clothing, which scratches coatings. Individually wrapped lens wipes are pre-moistened with a gentle alcohol-based cleaner that removes grease without streaks and are easy to carry. Wipe both sides from the centre outwards and let dry. Rinse grit off with water before wiping to avoid scratches. A 30–50 pack lasts one to two months of daily use.","Lenzi zenye madoa au mikwaruzo hupunguza utofautishaji na hufanya uoni hafifu kuwa mbaya zaidi, na wazee wengi husafisha miwani kwa nguo, jambo linalokwaruza tabaka la juu la lenzi. Wipes za lenzi zilizofungwa moja moja zimelowanishwa kwa kisafishaji laini chenye pombe kinachoondoa mafuta bila kuacha mistari na ni rahisi kubeba. Futa pande zote mbili kuanzia katikati kuelekea nje na acha zikauke. Suuza mchanga kwa maji kabla ya kufuta ili kuepuka mikwaruzo. Pakiti ya wipes 30–50 hudumu mwezi mmoja hadi miwili kwa matumizi ya kila siku."],["Small add-on sold with every pair of readers; repeat consumable","Nyongeza ndogo inayouzwa pamoja na kila jozi ya miwani; bidhaa inayotumika na kununuliwa tena"]],"sn_sens_batt":[["Many devices that keep older people safe, from blood-pressure monitors to torches, call bells and day clocks, stop working at the worst moment when batteries run flat. Alkaline cells last much longer than zinc-carbon \"heavy duty\" cells in these devices. Replace all batteries in a device at the same time, remove them from items not used for months to prevent leaking, and keep a spare pack in a known drawer. Write the date on new batteries with a marker. A household with several devices uses one or two packs a month.","Vifaa vingi vinavyowaweka wazee salama, kuanzia vipima shinikizo la damu hadi tochi, kengele za kuita na saa za siku, huacha kufanya kazi wakati mbaya zaidi betri zinapoisha. Betri za alkaline hudumu muda mrefu zaidi kuliko betri za zinc-carbon kwenye vifaa hivi. Badilisha betri zote za kifaa kwa wakati mmoja, ziondoe kwenye vifaa visivyotumika kwa miezi ili zisivuje, na weka pakiti ya ziada kwenye droo inayojulikana. Andika tarehe kwenye betri mpya kwa kalamu. Kaya yenye vifaa kadhaa hutumia pakiti moja au mbili kwa mwezi."],["Everyday consumable that keeps every device Afya sells working; easy till add-on","Bidhaa ya kila siku inayoweka kila kifaa kinachouzwa na Afya kifanye kazi; nyongeza rahisi kaunta"]],"sn_med_daily":[["A small two-compartment box separates morning and evening doses and fits in a pocket or handbag, so doses are not missed when visiting, at the mosque or church, or at the market. It suits people on two or three daily medicines. Fill it each morning from the weekly organiser or original packs and keep the original packs at home for labels and expiry dates. Choose clear lids and large AM/PM markings. Missed blood-pressure or diabetes doses are a common reason for poor control.","Kisanduku kidogo chenye vyumba viwili hutenganisha dozi za asubuhi na jioni na huingia mfukoni au kwenye mkoba, hivyo dozi hazikosekani mtu anapotembelea, akiwa msikitini au kanisani, au sokoni. Kinafaa kwa watu wanaotumia dawa mbili au tatu kwa siku. Kijaze kila asubuhi kutoka kwenye kisanduku cha wiki au pakiti za awali na weka pakiti za awali nyumbani kwa ajili ya lebo na tarehe za mwisho wa matumizi. Chagua chenye mifuniko inayoonyesha ndani na alama kubwa za asubuhi na jioni. Kukosa dozi za shinikizo la damu au kisukari ni sababu ya kawaida ya magonjwa haya kutodhibitiwa."],["Low-cost adherence tool sold alongside chronic-disease purchases","Kifaa cha bei nafuu cha kufuata dawa kinachouzwa pamoja na ununuzi wa magonjwa sugu"]],"sn_med_weekly":[["A seven-day organiser with one to four compartments per day lets a carer or the person set out a whole week of tablets at once, and makes it obvious at a glance whether today's dose was taken. Older people often take five or more medicines, and confusion between similar tablets is a major cause of harm. Choose large compartments, raised day letters, and easy-open or push-button lids for arthritic fingers. Fill it on the same day each week, check against the prescription list and keep it away from heat and children. Organisers are not suitable for medicines that must stay in their foil, such as some effervescent or moisture-sensitive tablets; ask the pharmacist.","Kisanduku cha siku saba chenye vyumba kimoja hadi vinne kwa siku humwezesha mlezi au mtu mwenyewe kupanga vidonge vya wiki nzima kwa wakati mmoja, na huonyesha wazi mara moja ikiwa dozi ya leo imemezwa. Wazee mara nyingi hutumia dawa tano au zaidi, na kuchanganya vidonge vinavyofanana ni chanzo kikubwa cha madhara. Chagua chenye vyumba vikubwa, herufi za siku zilizoinuka, na mifuniko rahisi kufungua au ya kubonyeza kwa vidole vyenye baridi yabisi. Kijaze siku ileile kila wiki, hakiki dhidi ya orodha ya dawa za daktari na kiweke mbali na joto na watoto. Visanduku hivi havifai kwa dawa zinazopaswa kubaki kwenye karatasi zake za bati, kama baadhi ya vidonge vinavyochemka au vinavyoharibika kwa unyevu; muulize mfamasia."],["Core safety product that opens conversations about chronic-medicine refills and subscriptions","Bidhaa kuu ya usalama inayofungua mazungumzo kuhusu kujaza tena dawa za magonjwa sugu na usajili"]],"sn_med_cutter":[["Breaking tablets with a kitchen knife or fingers gives uneven pieces and wasted doses. A pill cutter holds the tablet in a V-shaped cradle and a shielded blade splits it cleanly. Only split tablets that are scored or that the pharmacist confirms can be split: modified-release, enteric-coated and capsule medicines must never be cut. Clean the blade after use and keep it away from children. A good cutter lasts years.","Kuvunja vidonge kwa kisu cha jikoni au vidole hutoa vipande visivyo sawa na dozi zinazopotea. Kikata vidonge hushikilia kidonge kwenye kitanda chenye umbo la V na kisu kilichofunikwa hukigawa vizuri. Gawa tu vidonge vyenye mstari au ambavyo mfamasia amethibitisha vinaweza kugawanywa: vidonge vinavyoachia dawa taratibu, vilivyopakwa tabaka maalum na kapsuli kamwe visikatwe. Safisha kisu baada ya kutumia na weka mbali na watoto. Kikata kizuri hudumu miaka mingi."],["Small, useful, high-margin device that supports accurate dosing","Kifaa kidogo, chenye manufaa na faida kubwa kinachosaidia dozi sahihi"]],"sn_med_crusher":[["Swallowing difficulty is common after stroke, in dementia and in frailty, and people may stop taking tablets they cannot swallow. A twist-action crusher turns a tablet into fine powder that can be mixed with a spoon of soft food such as uji or yoghurt. Always ask a pharmacist first: slow-release, coated and some other medicines become dangerous or useless when crushed, and a liquid form may be available. Crush one medicine at a time, give immediately and clean the crusher between medicines. Coughing or choking at meals needs a health worker's swallowing assessment.","Shida ya kumeza ni ya kawaida baada ya kiharusi, kwa wenye shida ya kusahau na kwa walio dhaifu, na watu wanaweza kuacha kutumia vidonge wasivyoweza kumeza. Kisaga cha kuzungusha hubadilisha kidonge kuwa unga laini unaoweza kuchanganywa na kijiko cha chakula laini kama uji au mtindi. Daima muulize mfamasia kwanza: dawa zinazoachia taratibu, zilizopakwa tabaka maalum na nyinginezo huwa hatari au hazifanyi kazi zikisagwa, na huenda kuna dawa ya maji. Saga dawa moja kwa wakati, mpe mara moja na safisha kisaga kati ya dawa moja na nyingine. Kukohoa au kupaliwa wakati wa kula kunahitaji mhudumu wa afya kuchunguza uwezo wa kumeza."],["Inexpensive specialist aid that shows Afya understands real caregiving problems","Kifaa maalum cha bei nafuu kinachoonyesha Afya inaelewa matatizo halisi ya ulezi"]],"sn_med_clock":[["A day clock shows the full day of the week, date and part of day (\"Morning\", \"Afternoon\") in very large, high-contrast letters. For a person living with dementia this reduces repeated questions, anxiety and missed routines, and it helps them know when to take medicines or expect a visitor. Place it where the person spends most time and at eye level. Choose a mains-powered model with battery backup that resets after power cuts. It works best together with a written daily routine and regular, calm reminders from family.","Saa ya siku huonyesha siku kamili ya wiki, tarehe na sehemu ya siku (\"Asubuhi\", \"Mchana\") kwa herufi kubwa sana zenye utofautishaji mkubwa. Kwa mtu anayeishi na shida ya kusahau hupunguza maswali ya kurudiwa, wasiwasi na kukosa ratiba, na humsaidia kujua wakati wa kumeza dawa au kutarajia mgeni. Iweke mahali mtu anapokaa muda mwingi na kwenye usawa wa macho. Chagua inayotumia umeme wa nyumbani yenye betri ya akiba inayojirekebisha baada ya umeme kukatika. Hufanya kazi vizuri zaidi pamoja na ratiba ya siku iliyoandikwa na vikumbusho vya mara kwa mara vya utulivu kutoka kwa familia."],["Distinctive, giftable dementia aid that few Tanzanian shops offer","Kifaa cha kipekee cha shida ya kusahau kinachofaa kama zawadi ambacho maduka machache ya Tanzania yanacho"]],"sn_med_board":[["A small whiteboard hung in the kitchen or bedroom becomes the household's shared memory: today's day, who is visiting, clinic appointments, and a tick-box for each medicine dose. It is especially helpful when several family members share caring, because everyone sees what has been done. Write in large, dark letters and keep the message short. Wipe and update each morning as part of the routine. Pair it with a day clock for people with memory problems.","Ubao mdogo mweupe uliotundikwa jikoni au chumbani huwa kumbukumbu ya pamoja ya kaya: siku ya leo, nani anakuja kutembelea, miadi ya kliniki, na kisanduku cha kuweka alama kwa kila dozi ya dawa. Ni muhimu hasa pale wanafamilia kadhaa wanapogawana ulezi, kwa sababu kila mmoja anaona kilichofanyika. Andika kwa herufi kubwa nyeusi na ujumbe mfupi. Futa na sasisha kila asubuhi kama sehemu ya ratiba. Ambatanisha na saa ya siku kwa watu wenye matatizo ya kumbukumbu."],["Low-cost, high-impact aid that ties the medicine and memory range together","Kifaa cha bei nafuu chenye matokeo makubwa kinachounganisha bidhaa za dawa na kumbukumbu"]],"sn_med_record":[["An up-to-date written list of every medicine, dose and time, along with allergies, blood-pressure or sugar readings and clinic dates, is one of the simplest ways to prevent medicine errors when an older person sees several doctors or is admitted to hospital. Use a durable notebook kept with the pill organiser and take it to every appointment. Record new readings with the date and time. Families caring at a distance can photograph each page and share it. One notebook lasts many months.","Orodha iliyoandikwa na iliyosasishwa ya kila dawa, dozi na saa, pamoja na mizio, vipimo vya shinikizo la damu au sukari na tarehe za kliniki, ni mojawapo ya njia rahisi zaidi za kuzuia makosa ya dawa pale mzee anapowaona madaktari kadhaa au anapolazwa hospitalini. Tumia daftari imara linalowekwa pamoja na kisanduku cha dawa na lipeleke kila miadi. Andika vipimo vipya pamoja na tarehe na saa. Familia zinazohudumia kwa mbali zinaweza kupiga picha kila ukurasa na kushirikiana. Daftari moja hudumu miezi mingi."],["Very low-cost item that supports safe care and keeps chronic customers organised","Bidhaa ya bei ndogo sana inayosaidia huduma salama na kuwapanga wateja wa magonjwa sugu"]],"sn_med_pain":[["Paracetamol is the first-choice pain reliever for most older people because, at the right dose, it does not irritate the stomach, raise blood pressure or harm the kidneys the way anti-inflammatory painkillers can. The usual adult dose is 500 mg–1 g up to four times a day, with at least four hours between doses and no more than 4 g in 24 hours; frail adults under 50 kg and those with liver disease need a lower dose. Check other medicines and cold remedies for hidden paracetamol to avoid accidental overdose. Pain that persists more than a few days, or comes with swelling, fever or weight loss, needs medical review.","Paracetamol ni dawa ya kwanza ya kupunguza maumivu kwa wazee wengi kwa sababu, ikitumika kwa dozi sahihi, haiwashi tumbo, haipandishi shinikizo la damu wala haidhuru figo kama dawa za maumivu za kupunguza uvimbe zinavyoweza kufanya. Dozi ya kawaida ya mtu mzima ni miligramu 500 hadi gramu 1 hadi mara nne kwa siku, kwa angalau saa nne kati ya dozi na si zaidi ya gramu 4 kwa saa 24; wazee dhaifu wenye uzito chini ya kilo 50 na wenye ugonjwa wa ini wanahitaji dozi ndogo zaidi. Kagua dawa nyingine na dawa za mafua kama zina paracetamol iliyofichika ili kuepuka kuzidisha dozi bila kujua. Maumivu yanayoendelea zaidi ya siku chache, au yanayoambatana na uvimbe, homa au kupungua uzito, yanahitaji uchunguzi wa daktari."],["Everyday OTC staple with high volume; counsel-led sale builds trust","Dawa ya kila siku isiyohitaji cheti yenye mauzo makubwa; ushauri wakati wa kuuza hujenga imani"]],"sn_nut_ons":[["Oral nutrition supplements are powders mixed with water or milk that provide balanced energy, protein, vitamins and minerals in a small volume. Unplanned weight loss and muscle loss are common in older age and raise the risk of falls, infection and slow healing. Use them between meals, not instead of meals, typically one or two servings a day; a 400 g tin gives about 7–10 servings. People with diabetes should prefer a diabetes-specific formula and monitor sugar. Ongoing weight loss always needs a health check.","Virutubisho vya lishe ni unga unaochanganywa na maji au maziwa unaotoa nishati, protini, vitamini na madini kwa uwiano mzuri katika kiasi kidogo. Kupungua uzito bila kukusudia na kupoteza misuli ni jambo la kawaida uzeeni na huongeza hatari ya kuanguka, maambukizi na kupona polepole. Vitumie kati ya milo, si badala ya milo, kwa kawaida kipimo kimoja au viwili kwa siku; kopo la gramu 400 hutoa takriban vipimo 7–10. Watu wenye kisukari wanapaswa kupendelea aina maalum ya kisukari na kufuatilia sukari. Kupungua uzito kunakoendelea daima kunahitaji uchunguzi wa afya."],["High-value repeat purchase recommended by clinicians after hospital discharge","Ununuzi wa thamani kubwa unaorudiwa unaopendekezwa na wataalamu baada ya kuruhusiwa hospitalini"]],"sn_nut_milk":[["Milk is one of the easiest ways for an older person to get protein for muscles and calcium for bones, but fresh milk is not always available or affordable daily. Full-cream milk powder fortified with vitamins can be stirred into tea, uji or mashed food to boost nutrition without adding volume. Two to three tablespoons add about 5–8 g of protein. Store sealed in a cool, dry place and use clean, dry spoons. People who need to limit fat can choose lower-fat options on advice.","Maziwa ni mojawapo ya njia rahisi zaidi kwa mzee kupata protini kwa misuli na kalsiamu kwa mifupa, lakini maziwa freshi hayapatikani wala hayamudiwi kila siku. Maziwa ya unga yenye mafuta kamili yaliyoongezewa vitamini yanaweza kukorogwa kwenye chai, uji au chakula kilichopondwa ili kuongeza lishe bila kuongeza wingi wa chakula. Vijiko vikubwa viwili hadi vitatu huongeza takriban gramu 5–8 za protini. Hifadhi yakiwa yamefungwa mahali pakavu na penye ubaridi na tumia vijiko safi na vikavu. Watu wanaohitaji kupunguza mafuta wanaweza kuchagua aina zenye mafuta kidogo kwa ushauri."],["Household staple that brings senior shoppers in weekly","Bidhaa ya msingi ya nyumbani inayowaleta wanunuzi wa wazee kila wiki"]],"sn_nut_oats":[["Oats cook into a soft porridge that is easy to chew and swallow, and their soluble fibre (beta-glucan) helps lower cholesterol, eases constipation and releases energy slowly, which suits people with diabetes. Whole-wheat biscuits soften quickly in warm milk. Cook with milk or add milk powder, a little fruit or groundnut paste for protein; avoid adding a lot of sugar. A 500 g pack makes about 12 servings. Good fibre and fluid intake is the first step against constipation, a daily problem for many older people.","Shayiri hupikika kuwa uji laini unaorahisisha kutafuna na kumeza, na nyuzinyuzi zake zinazoyeyuka (beta-glucan) husaidia kupunguza lehemu, hurahisisha choo na huachia nishati taratibu, jambo linalofaa watu wenye kisukari. Biskuti za ngano nzima hulainika haraka kwenye maziwa ya uvuguvugu. Pika kwa maziwa au ongeza maziwa ya unga, tunda kidogo au siagi ya karanga kwa protini; epuka kuongeza sukari nyingi. Pakiti ya gramu 500 hutoa takriban milo 12. Kupata nyuzinyuzi na maji ya kutosha ni hatua ya kwanza dhidi ya kufunga choo, tatizo la kila siku kwa wazee wengi."],["Affordable food staple that ties nutrition advice to repeat grocery spend","Chakula cha msingi cha bei nafuu kinachounganisha ushauri wa lishe na matumizi ya mara kwa mara"]],"sn_nut_uji":[["Uji is a familiar, comforting food that most Tanzanian elders accept even when unwell, which makes it an ideal carrier for extra nutrition. Fortified and multi-grain flours add vitamins, minerals and often protein from soya or millet. Cook thick enough to provide energy, and enrich with milk, milk powder, groundnut paste or an egg. Thin, watery uji fills the stomach without much nutrition. A 1 kg pack provides around 15–20 bowls.","Uji ni chakula kinachojulikana na kinachoburudisha ambacho wazee wengi wa Kitanzania hukikubali hata wakiwa wagonjwa, jambo linaloufanya kuwa njia bora ya kubeba lishe ya ziada. Unga ulioongezewa virutubisho na wa nafaka mchanganyiko huongeza vitamini, madini na mara nyingi protini kutoka soya au ulezi. Pika uji mzito wa kutosha kutoa nishati, na uongezee maziwa, maziwa ya unga, siagi ya karanga au yai. Uji mwepesi wa maji hujaza tumbo bila lishe kubwa. Pakiti ya kilo 1 hutoa takriban bakuli 15–20."],["Culturally familiar, affordable product that wins everyday loyalty","Bidhaa inayojulikana kiutamaduni na ya bei nafuu inayojenga uaminifu wa kila siku"]],"sn_nut_calcium":[["Bones lose density with age, especially in women after menopause, and a fall can then break a hip or wrist. Calcium builds bone and vitamin D helps the body absorb it and supports muscle strength. Most adults over 50 need about 1,000–1,200 mg of calcium a day from food and supplements combined; take supplements with meals and split doses above 500 mg. People with kidney stones, kidney disease or on certain heart medicines should ask a health worker first. Supplements work best together with weight-bearing activity and fall prevention.","Mifupa hupoteza uzito wake kwa umri, hasa kwa wanawake baada ya kukoma hedhi, na kuanguka kunaweza kuvunja nyonga au kifundo cha mkono. Kalsiamu hujenga mfupa na vitamini D husaidia mwili kuifyonza na husaidia nguvu za misuli. Watu wazima wengi zaidi ya miaka 50 wanahitaji takriban miligramu 1,000–1,200 za kalsiamu kwa siku kutoka kwenye chakula na virutubisho kwa pamoja; meza virutubisho pamoja na chakula na gawanya dozi zinazozidi miligramu 500. Watu wenye mawe ya figo, ugonjwa wa figo au wanaotumia baadhi ya dawa za moyo wanapaswa kumuuliza mhudumu wa afya kwanza. Virutubisho hufanya kazi vizuri zaidi pamoja na mazoezi ya kubeba uzito wa mwili na kuzuia kuanguka."],["Steady monthly supplement with strong margin and natural cross-sell to fall-prevention items","Kirutubisho thabiti cha kila mwezi chenye faida kubwa na uhusiano wa asili na bidhaa za kuzuia kuanguka"]],"sn_nut_multi":[["Age-specific multivitamins adjust nutrients to older bodies, typically with more vitamin B12, vitamin D and zinc and less iron, since absorption of B12 falls with age and iron overload is a risk for older men and post-menopausal women. They help fill gaps when meals are small or repetitive, but they do not replace a varied diet. Take one a day with food. Check with a pharmacist if the person takes blood thinners or several other supplements, to avoid interactions or excess vitamin A.","Multivitamini za umri maalum hurekebisha virutubisho kwa miili ya wazee, kwa kawaida zikiwa na vitamini B12, vitamini D na zinki zaidi na chuma kidogo, kwa sababu ufyonzaji wa B12 hupungua kwa umri na chuma kingi ni hatari kwa wanaume wazee na wanawake waliokoma hedhi. Husaidia kujaza mapengo pale milo inapokuwa midogo au ya aina moja, lakini haichukui nafasi ya mlo wenye aina mbalimbali za vyakula. Meza moja kwa siku pamoja na chakula. Wasiliana na mfamasia ikiwa mtu anatumia dawa za kupunguza kuganda kwa damu au virutubisho vingine kadhaa, ili kuepuka mwingiliano au vitamini A iliyozidi."],["Premium monthly repeat with strong gifting appeal from adult children","Bidhaa ya hali ya juu inayorudiwa kila mwezi na inayovutia kama zawadi kutoka kwa watoto wakubwa"]],"sn_nut_omega":[["Oily fish such as dagaa, sardines and mackerel provide omega-3 fats and vitamin D, but many older people eat them rarely. Cod liver oil and fish-oil capsules are a convenient supplement; one capsule a day with food is typical. Do not combine with other vitamin A-rich supplements, and ask a pharmacist if the person takes blood thinners. Evidence for omega-3 preventing heart attacks in healthy people is mixed, so the best advice remains to eat fish two or more times a week when possible.","Samaki wenye mafuta kama dagaa, sadini na makrili hutoa mafuta ya omega-3 na vitamini D, lakini wazee wengi huwala mara chache. Kapsuli za mafuta ya ini ya samaki na mafuta ya samaki ni kirutubisho rahisi; kapsuli moja kwa siku pamoja na chakula ni kawaida. Usichanganye na virutubisho vingine vyenye vitamini A nyingi, na muulize mfamasia ikiwa mtu anatumia dawa za kupunguza kuganda kwa damu. Ushahidi kwamba omega-3 huzuia mshtuko wa moyo kwa watu wenye afya ni mchanganyiko, kwa hiyo ushauri bora unabaki kula samaki mara mbili au zaidi kwa wiki inapowezekana."],["Well-known heritage brand with loyal older buyers","Chapa ya muda mrefu inayojulikana yenye wanunuzi wazee waaminifu"]],"sn_nut_fibre":[["Constipation affects many older people because of less activity, low fluid intake, low-fibre diets and medicines such as iron, calcium, some pain relievers and blood-pressure tablets. Ispaghula husk is a gentle bulk-forming fibre that softens stool and makes it easier to pass, and is safe for long-term use. Mix one sachet in a full glass of water and drink immediately, once or twice a day, and drink plenty of fluids through the day. Do not take it just before bed or if there is difficulty swallowing. Sudden change in bowel habit, blood in stool or weight loss needs medical review.","Kufunga choo huwaathiri wazee wengi kwa sababu ya kutofanya shughuli nyingi, kunywa maji kidogo, lishe yenye nyuzinyuzi kidogo na dawa kama chuma, kalsiamu, baadhi ya dawa za maumivu na za shinikizo la damu. Maganda ya ispaghula ni nyuzinyuzi laini zinazoongeza wingi wa choo, hulainisha choo na kurahisisha kutoka, na ni salama kwa matumizi ya muda mrefu. Changanya pakiti moja kwenye glasi kamili ya maji na unywe mara moja, mara moja au mbili kwa siku, na unywe maji mengi mchana kutwa. Usitumie kabla tu ya kulala au ikiwa kuna shida ya kumeza. Mabadiliko ya ghafla ya choo, damu kwenye choo au kupungua uzito kunahitaji uchunguzi wa daktari."],["Discreet, high-need OTC product with strong repeat; complements oats and hydration","Bidhaa ya dukani yenye hitaji kubwa inayonunuliwa kwa usiri na kurudiwa sana; inakamilisha shayiri na unywaji wa maji"]],"sn_nut_tea":[["Thirst sensation weakens with age, so many older people drink too little, which leads to constipation, confusion, urinary infections and dizziness, especially in hot months. Warm, pleasant-tasting herbal teas such as rooibos, ginger or green tea are an easy way to raise fluid intake; rooibos is naturally caffeine-free and suits the evening. Aim for six to eight cups of fluid a day unless a doctor has advised a limit for heart or kidney disease. Limit sugar, and avoid strong tea with meals as it reduces iron absorption.","Hisia ya kiu hudhoofika kwa umri, kwa hiyo wazee wengi hunywa kidogo mno, jambo linalosababisha kufunga choo, kuchanganyikiwa, maambukizi ya njia ya mkojo na kizunguzungu, hasa wakati wa joto. Chai za mitishamba za uvuguvugu zenye ladha nzuri kama rooibos, tangawizi au chai ya kijani ni njia rahisi ya kuongeza vinywaji; rooibos haina kafeini kiasili na inafaa jioni. Lenga vikombe sita hadi nane vya vinywaji kwa siku isipokuwa daktari ameshauri kikomo kwa ugonjwa wa moyo au figo. Punguza sukari, na epuka chai kali wakati wa kula kwa sababu hupunguza ufyonzaji wa chuma."],["Pleasant, affordable everyday purchase that supports a hydration message","Ununuzi wa kila siku wa bei nafuu na wenye ladha nzuri unaounga mkono ujumbe wa kunywa maji"]],"sn_safe_night":[["Most falls among older people happen at home, and a large share happen at night on the way to the toilet, when eyes adjust slowly to the dark and blood pressure drops on standing. A low plug-in night light in the bedroom and corridor, and a motion-sensor bulb in the toilet, light the path without needing to find a switch. Use warm, soft light that does not disturb sleep. Combine with sitting on the edge of the bed for a minute before standing. This is one of the cheapest and most effective fall-prevention steps a family can take.","Maporomoko mengi ya wazee hutokea nyumbani, na sehemu kubwa hutokea usiku wakienda chooni, wakati macho huzoea giza polepole na shinikizo la damu hushuka wanaposimama. Taa ndogo ya usiku inayochomekwa ukutani chumbani na kwenye ujia, na balbu yenye kihisi cha mwendo chooni, huangaza njia bila kuhitaji kutafuta swichi. Tumia mwanga wa joto na laini usiovuruga usingizi. Ambatanisha na kukaa ukingoni mwa kitanda kwa dakika moja kabla ya kusimama. Hii ni mojawapo ya hatua nafuu zaidi na zenye ufanisi mkubwa wa kuzuia kuanguka ambazo familia inaweza kuchukua."],["Low-cost, high-impact safety product with clear story for adult children buying for parents","Bidhaa ya usalama ya bei nafuu yenye matokeo makubwa na hadithi wazi kwa watoto wakubwa wanaowanunulia wazazi"]],"sn_safe_mat":[["Tiled bathroom floors become extremely slippery when wet with soapy water, and bathroom falls often cause head injuries and hip fractures. A rubber mat with suction cups grips the floor inside the shower, while an absorbent mat with a rubber back stops slipping when stepping out. Choose a mat large enough for both feet, check suction cups weekly and lift the mat to dry after use to prevent mould. Replace when edges curl. Mats complement, but do not replace, grab bars and shower chairs.","Sakafu za vigae za bafuni huteleza sana zikiwa na maji yenye sabuni, na kuanguka bafuni mara nyingi husababisha majeraha ya kichwa na kuvunjika nyonga. Mkeka wa mpira wenye vikombe vya kunyonya hushika sakafu ndani ya bafu, wakati mkeka unaonyonya maji wenye mgongo wa mpira huzuia kuteleza unapotoka. Chagua mkeka mkubwa wa kutosha miguu yote miwili, kagua vikombe vya kunyonya kila wiki na inua mkeka kuukausha baada ya matumizi ili kuzuia ukungu. Badilisha kingo zinapojikunja. Mikeka husaidiana na, lakini haichukui nafasi ya, vishikio vya ukutani na viti vya kuogea."],["Affordable visible safety item that starts the conversation about bathroom safety","Bidhaa ya usalama ya bei nafuu inayoonekana inayoanzisha mazungumzo kuhusu usalama wa bafuni"]],"sn_safe_rug":[["Loose rugs and door mats on tiled or terrazzo floors are a leading trip hazard for older people, especially those who shuffle or use a walking aid. Adhesive corner grippers or a non-slip underlay hold the rug flat and in place. Clean and dry the floor before fitting and press firmly. Where a rug still curls or the person uses a frame, it is safer to remove it entirely. Check rugs during a simple home safety walk-through, together with lighting, cables and clutter.","Zulia na mikeka ya mlangoni iliyolegea kwenye sakafu ya vigae au terazo ni chanzo kikuu cha kujikwaa kwa wazee, hasa wale wanaoburuta miguu au wanaotumia kifaa cha kutembelea. Vishikio vya pembe vinavyonata au tabaka lisiloteleza hushikilia zulia likiwa bapa na mahali pake. Safisha na kausha sakafu kabla ya kuweka na bonyeza kwa nguvu. Pale zulia bado linajikunja au mtu anatumia fremu ya kutembelea, ni salama zaidi kuliondoa kabisa. Kagua zulia wakati wa ukaguzi rahisi wa usalama wa nyumba, pamoja na mwanga, nyaya na vitu vilivyotapakaa."],["Very low-cost safety add-on; sells with mats and night lights as a fall-prevention bundle","Nyongeza ya usalama ya bei ndogo sana; huuzwa pamoja na mikeka na taa za usiku kama kifurushi cha kuzuia kuanguka"]],"sn_safe_socks":[["Walking in ordinary socks on tiles is one of the easiest ways to slip. Grip socks have rubber dots on the sole that hold the floor, and they keep feet warm at night in the cool season. They are useful for people who refuse slippers or kick them off, and in hospital. Choose the right size with a soft, non-tight top, and wash inside out to protect the grips. The safest everyday footwear remains a well-fitting, closed-back shoe or slipper with a thin, firm, non-slip sole.","Kutembea na soksi za kawaida kwenye vigae ni mojawapo ya njia rahisi zaidi za kuteleza. Soksi zenye mshiko zina vitone vya mpira chini vinavyoshika sakafu, na huweka miguu yenye joto usiku wakati wa baridi. Zinafaa kwa watu wanaokataa kandambili au wanaozivua, na hospitalini. Chagua saizi sahihi yenye juu laini isiyobana, na fua zikiwa zimegeuzwa ndani nje ili kulinda mshiko. Viatu salama zaidi vya kila siku vinabaki kuwa viatu au kandambili zinazokaa vizuri zenye nyuma iliyofungwa na soli nyembamba imara isiyoteleza."],["Cheap, giftable safety item with a clear benefit families understand immediately","Bidhaa ya usalama ya bei nafuu inayofaa kama zawadi yenye faida wazi ambayo familia huielewa mara moja"]],"sn_safe_torch":[["Power cuts at night leave older people in total darkness, which is a major fall risk. A torch kept on the bedside table, within reach and in the same place every night, lets the person find their way safely. Rechargeable LED torches avoid the cost of batteries and are brighter; battery torches are useful as backup. Teach the person to switch on the torch before getting out of bed. Check charge or batteries monthly.","Umeme ukikatika usiku huwaacha wazee katika giza totoro, jambo ambalo ni hatari kubwa ya kuanguka. Tochi inayowekwa kwenye meza ya kando ya kitanda, inayofikika na mahali palepale kila usiku, humwezesha mtu kupata njia yake kwa usalama. Tochi za LED zinazochajiwa huepusha gharama ya betri na zina mwanga mkali zaidi; tochi za betri ni muhimu kama akiba. Mfundishe mtu kuwasha tochi kabla ya kushuka kitandani. Kagua chaji au betri kila mwezi."],["Simple, practical item tied to the reality of power cuts; good impulse add-on","Kifaa rahisi cha vitendo kinachoendana na hali halisi ya kukatika kwa umeme; nyongeza nzuri ya ghafla"]],"sn_safe_bell":[["A wireless call bell has a small push button that the older person keeps by the bed or wears, and a plug-in or battery receiver that rings in the kitchen or carer's room. It means the person does not try to get up alone, or shout, when they need help with the toilet or feel unwell. Choose a model with a range that covers the whole house and a volume loud enough to hear over the TV. Test it daily and keep spare batteries. It gives both the older person and family peace of mind.","Kengele ya kuita isiyo na waya ina kitufe kidogo ambacho mzee hukiweka kando ya kitanda au hukivaa, na kipokezi cha kuchomeka au cha betri kinacholia jikoni au chumbani mwa mlezi. Humaanisha mtu hajaribu kuamka peke yake, wala kupiga kelele, anapohitaji msaada wa kwenda chooni au anapojisikia vibaya. Chagua yenye umbali wa kufika nyumba nzima na sauti kubwa ya kutosha kusikika hata televisheni ikiwa imewashwa. Ijaribu kila siku na weka betri za ziada. Huwapa mzee na familia amani ya moyo."],["Distinctive caregiving product with gifting appeal and few local sellers","Bidhaa ya kipekee ya ulezi inayofaa kama zawadi yenye wauzaji wachache wa ndani"]],"sn_bed_gloves":[["Gloves protect both the carer and the older person from germs in urine, faeces, blood and wounds. Nitrile gloves are strong and latex-free, which matters because latex allergy is common; powder-free gloves are gentler on skin. Put on fresh gloves for each task, remove by peeling inside out and wash hands afterwards: gloves never replace handwashing. A family doing four changes a day uses roughly a 100-glove box every two to three weeks. Choose the right size so gloves do not tear.","Glavu humlinda mlezi na mzee dhidi ya vijidudu vilivyo kwenye mkojo, choo, damu na vidonda. Glavu za nitrile ni imara na hazina mpira asilia, jambo muhimu kwa sababu mzio wa mpira ni wa kawaida; glavu zisizo na unga ni laini zaidi kwa ngozi. Vaa glavu mpya kwa kila kazi, vua kwa kuzigeuza ndani nje na nawa mikono baadaye: glavu kamwe hazichukui nafasi ya kunawa mikono. Familia inayobadilisha mara nne kwa siku hutumia takriban boksi la glavu 100 kila wiki mbili hadi tatu. Chagua saizi sahihi ili glavu zisichanike."],["High-volume consumable for every caregiving household; pairs with briefs in the monthly box","Bidhaa inayotumika kwa wingi katika kila kaya ya ulezi; huenda pamoja na nepi kwenye boksi la kila mwezi"]],"sn_bed_apron":[["A waterproof apron keeps splashes of water, food, urine and stool off the carer's clothing, which reduces laundry and the spread of germs between the sick room and the rest of the home. Reusable PVC aprons wipe clean with soap and disinfectant after each use. Hang the apron in the care room rather than wearing it into the kitchen. Combine with gloves for any task involving body fluids.","Aproni isiyopitisha maji huzuia michirizi ya maji, chakula, mkojo na choo kufika kwenye nguo za mlezi, hivyo kupunguza ufuaji na kuenea kwa vijidudu kati ya chumba cha mgonjwa na sehemu nyingine ya nyumba. Aproni za PVC zinazotumika tena hufutwa kwa sabuni na dawa ya kuua vijidudu baada ya kila matumizi. Tundika aproni ndani ya chumba cha huduma badala ya kuivaa jikoni. Ambatanisha na glavu kwa kazi yoyote inayohusisha majimaji ya mwili."],["Durable, practical carer purchase that signals professional-grade care at home","Ununuzi imara na wa vitendo wa mlezi unaoashiria huduma ya kiwango cha kitaalamu nyumbani"]],"sn_bed_rub":[["Older people are more vulnerable to infections, and the hands of carers and visitors are the main way germs travel to them. An alcohol hand rub with at least 60–70% alcohol kills most germs in 20–30 seconds; moisturising formulas protect the carer's skin from cracking with frequent use. Keep a pump bottle at the bedside and the entrance and ask visitors to use it. Wash with soap and water instead when hands are visibly dirty or after contact with diarrhoea. Store away from heat and flames.","Wazee wako hatarini zaidi kupata maambukizi, na mikono ya walezi na wageni ndiyo njia kuu ya vijidudu kuwafikia. Kitakasa mikono chenye pombe angalau asilimia 60–70 huua vijidudu vingi ndani ya sekunde 20–30; aina zenye kilainishi hulinda ngozi ya mlezi isipasuke kwa matumizi ya mara kwa mara. Weka chupa ya pampu kando ya kitanda na mlangoni na waombe wageni kuitumia. Nawa kwa sabuni na maji badala yake mikono ikiwa michafu inayoonekana au baada ya kugusa kuharisha. Hifadhi mbali na joto na moto."],["Steady consumable with year-round demand and peaks in the rainy seasons","Bidhaa inayotumika kila mara yenye mahitaji ya mwaka mzima na kuongezeka msimu wa mvua"]],"sn_bed_throw":[["Older people feel the cold more because they have less muscle and fat and their temperature control weakens, and even Dar es Salaam's cool June–September nights can chill a frail person sitting still. A lightweight fleece throw is warm without being heavy, dries quickly after washing and is soft on fragile skin. Avoid long throws that trail on the floor and become a trip hazard. It also makes a thoughtful get-well or festive gift.","Wazee huhisi baridi zaidi kwa sababu wana misuli na mafuta kidogo na udhibiti wao wa joto hudhoofika, na hata usiku wa baridi wa Juni hadi Septemba wa Dar es Salaam unaweza kumpoza mtu dhaifu aliyekaa bila kutembea. Blanketi jepesi la fleece lina joto bila kuwa zito, hukauka haraka baada ya kufuliwa na ni laini kwa ngozi dhaifu. Epuka mablanketi marefu yanayoburuzika sakafuni na kuwa chanzo cha kujikwaa. Pia ni zawadi nzuri ya kumtakia mgonjwa apone au ya sikukuu."],["Seasonal and gifting favourite with good ticket size","Bidhaa pendwa ya msimu na zawadi yenye bei nzuri kwa kila mauzo"]],"sn_foot_heel":[["Heel cracks are very common in older people who walk in open sandals on dusty ground, and deep fissures can bleed and become infected, especially in people with diabetes. Foot creams with 10–25% urea or rich oils soften thick skin and close cracks over one to two weeks. Apply twice daily after washing and drying the feet, avoiding between the toes, and wear cotton socks at night to boost absorption. Anyone with diabetes, poor circulation or numb feet should check their feet daily and see a health worker for any cut, blister or colour change.","Mipasuko ya visigino ni ya kawaida sana kwa wazee wanaotembea kwa makubadhi wazi kwenye ardhi yenye vumbi, na mipasuko mirefu inaweza kutoa damu na kuambukizwa, hasa kwa watu wenye kisukari. Krimu za miguu zenye urea asilimia 10–25 au mafuta mazito hulainisha ngozi ngumu na kufunga mipasuko ndani ya wiki moja hadi mbili. Paka mara mbili kwa siku baada ya kuosha na kukausha miguu, ukiepuka kati ya vidole, na vaa soksi za pamba usiku ili kuongeza ufyonzaji. Yeyote mwenye kisukari, mzunguko hafifu wa damu au miguu isiyohisi vizuri anapaswa kukagua miguu yake kila siku na kumwona mhudumu wa afya kwa jeraha lolote, lengelenge au mabadiliko ya rangi."],["Visible problem with fast visible results; premium creams drive repeat and word of mouth","Tatizo linaloonekana lenye matokeo ya haraka; krimu za hali ya juu huleta ununuzi wa kurudiwa na sifa kwa mdomo"]],"sn_foot_file":[["Thick calluses press on the foot like a stone in the shoe and crack easily. A double-sided foot file with a coarse and a fine side removes hard skin safely after soaking the feet for five to ten minutes. File gently in one direction a few times a week, and never use razor blades or sharp tools, which can cause deep cuts, especially in people with diabetes or poor eyesight. Follow with foot cream. Rinse and dry the file after use and keep it for personal use only.","Sugu nene hubana mguu kama jiwe ndani ya kiatu na hupasuka kwa urahisi. Kikwaruzo cha pande mbili chenye upande mgumu na laini huondoa ngozi ngumu kwa usalama baada ya kuloweka miguu kwa dakika tano hadi kumi. Kwaruza kwa upole upande mmoja mara chache kwa wiki, na kamwe usitumie viwembe au vifaa vikali, ambavyo vinaweza kusababisha majeraha makubwa, hasa kwa watu wenye kisukari au wasioona vizuri. Fuatisha krimu ya miguu. Suuza na kausha kikwaruzo baada ya kutumia na kiwe cha matumizi binafsi tu."],["Inexpensive companion to heel creams; easy add-on at the till","Mwenzi wa bei nafuu wa krimu za visigino; nyongeza rahisi kaunta"]],"sn_foot_clip":[["Toenails thicken and harden with age, and ordinary small clippers cannot cut them, so nails grow long, press into shoes and cause pain or ingrown nails. A larger, sharp, lever-action clipper cuts thick nails with less force. Trim after a bath when nails are softer, cut straight across and not too short, and file sharp corners. People with diabetes, poor circulation or very thick, discoloured nails should have nails cut by a health worker or trained foot-care provider.","Kucha za miguu huwa nene na ngumu kwa umri, na vikata kucha vidogo vya kawaida haviwezi kuzikata, kwa hiyo kucha hurefuka, hubana ndani ya viatu na husababisha maumivu au kucha kuingia ndani ya nyama. Kikata kikubwa, chenye makali na chenye mkono wa kubonyeza hukata kucha nene kwa nguvu kidogo. Kata baada ya kuoga kucha zikiwa laini zaidi, kata moja kwa moja bila kupinda na usikate fupi kupita kiasi, na kwaruza pembe kali. Watu wenye kisukari, mzunguko hafifu wa damu au kucha nene sana zilizobadilika rangi wanapaswa kukatwa kucha na mhudumu wa afya au mtaalamu wa miguu aliyefunzwa."],["Long-lasting quality tool with good margin; strong gift for parents","Kifaa bora kinachodumu chenye faida nzuri; zawadi nzuri kwa wazazi"]],"sn_foot_magclip":[["Poor near vision makes nail trimming risky, and many older people cut the skin or leave nails jagged. A clipper with a built-in magnifying lens enlarges the nail edge so the person can see where to cut, preserving independence in grooming. A small manicure set with a file and cuticle tool keeps everything together in one case. Use good light, trim after washing, and keep tools clean and personal. Anyone who cannot see or reach their toenails safely should ask for help.","Kutoona vizuri karibu hufanya kukata kucha kuwa hatari, na wazee wengi hujikata ngozi au huacha kucha zikiwa na ncha kali. Kikata kucha chenye lenzi kuza iliyojengwa ndani hukuza ukingo wa kucha ili mtu aone mahali pa kukata, hivyo kulinda uhuru wake wa kujitunza. Seti ndogo ya kucha yenye kikwaruzo na kifaa cha ngozi ya pembeni huweka kila kitu pamoja ndani ya kasha moja. Tumia mwanga mzuri, kata baada ya kunawa, na weka vifaa vikiwa safi na vya matumizi binafsi. Yeyote asiyeweza kuona au kufikia kucha zake za miguu kwa usalama aombe msaada."],["Thoughtful, giftable aid that supports independence; good margin","Kifaa cha busara kinachofaa kama zawadi kinachosaidia kujitegemea; faida nzuri"]],"sn_foot_socks":[["Clean cotton socks absorb sweat, reduce friction inside shoes and protect thin skin from blisters and cracks. Older people with swollen ankles need socks with a soft, non-binding top that does not leave a deep mark, since tight bands restrict circulation. Choose light colours that show any blood or discharge from an unnoticed wound, change daily and wash hot. Diabetic and compression socks are covered in other zones when specialist support is needed.","Soksi safi za pamba hunyonya jasho, hupunguza msuguano ndani ya viatu na hulinda ngozi nyembamba dhidi ya malengelenge na mipasuko. Wazee wenye vifundo vilivyovimba wanahitaji soksi zenye juu laini isiyobana isiyoacha alama ya kina, kwa sababu mikanda inayobana huzuia mzunguko wa damu. Chagua rangi nyepesi zinazoonyesha damu au usaha kutoka kwenye jeraha lisilogunduliwa, badilisha kila siku na fua kwa maji ya moto. Soksi za kisukari na za kubana zinapatikana katika maeneo mengine pale msaada maalum unapohitajika."],["Everyday staple with multi-pack value; easy cross-sell with heel balm","Bidhaa ya kila siku yenye thamani ya pakiti nyingi; rahisi kuuza pamoja na krimu ya visigino"]],"sn_foot_fungal":[["Fungal infections thrive in Dar es Salaam's heat and humidity, particularly between the toes, under the breasts, in the groin and under continence products. They cause itching, peeling, cracking and a red rash with a clear edge. Clotrimazole cream is an over-the-counter antifungal: apply thinly twice daily to clean, dry skin and continue for two weeks after the rash clears to stop it returning. Dry carefully between the toes after washing and change socks daily. Rashes that do not improve in two weeks, or occur in people with diabetes, should be seen by a health worker.","Maambukizi ya fangasi hustawi katika joto na unyevu wa Dar es Salaam, hasa kati ya vidole vya miguu, chini ya matiti, kwenye kinena na chini ya bidhaa za mkojo. Husababisha muwasho, kubanduka, mipasuko na upele mwekundu wenye ukingo ulio wazi. Krimu ya clotrimazole ni dawa ya fangasi isiyohitaji cheti: paka safu nyembamba mara mbili kwa siku kwenye ngozi safi na kavu na endelea kwa wiki mbili baada ya upele kupotea ili usirudi. Kausha vizuri kati ya vidole baada ya kuosha na badilisha soksi kila siku. Vipele visivyopungua ndani ya wiki mbili, au vinavyotokea kwa watu wenye kisukari, vinapaswa kuonwa na mhudumu wa afya."],["Common, recurring problem in a hot climate; trusted OTC brand with steady demand","Tatizo la kawaida linalojirudia katika hali ya joto; chapa ya dukani inayoaminika yenye mahitaji thabiti"]]};window.dispatchEvent(new Event("afyatx"));